  "published": "2026-10-19T18:44:25.937Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BREAKING - needs Core 0.7.0 and Config 0.4.0; the four services.LoadWeb*Configs calls are one services.AddWeb(configuration), a custom SQL executor is registered with UseSqlExecutor(factory), and optional parameters became overloads, e.g. Stub.Calls(id).WithMethod(...). BREAKING - renamed: WithParameterFrom / WithJsonBodyFrom read a variable, ConfigExtension is WebConfigExtension, WebEnvironmentResourceKinds is WebResourceKinds, and the proxies are nested in WebExt. A row whose key the database assigns is declared with Row<T>(id) and hands the key on with KeyTo, and a statement without a CommandTimeout runs under the step timeout.",
